### API
GET http://127.0.0.1:7777/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Ativos
GET http://127.0.0.1:7777/api/assets
Accept: application/json

### Adicionar ticker
POST http://127.0.0.1:7777/api/assets
Content-Type: application/json

{"symbol":"PETR4"}

### Atualizar precos (rede necessaria)
POST http://127.0.0.1:7777/api/assets/PETR4/refresh?force=true

### Ver risco apos atualizar precos
GET http://127.0.0.1:7777/api/analysis/risk/PETR4?days=365

### Correlacao
GET http://127.0.0.1:7777/api/analysis/correlation?symbols=PETR4,VALE3&days=365

### Carteira
GET http://127.0.0.1:7777/api/portfolio
